</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>
Relationship between contextual safety and model utility across all baselines, using Idefics as the base model. The <math id="A8.F14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>-axis represents averaged model utility across diverse tasks, while the <math id="A8.F14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>-axis reflects MSSBench (measured via undersensitivity). Both axes report overall averages.</figcaption>
</figure>
